#: scenario7:scenario7_F82E2626_05F1_49B0_B655_22D8351EAA85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 859d3cbaa916bb8a93be35ecdffebcc7ad237f84be9bd66a10751e6f06df8f43
#. default-sha256: 4b163fc1d7c44686a1395121d96661179237555b845fd069ef689bffff1bf466
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F82E2626_05F1_49B0_B655_22D8351EAA85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The archangel stood proudly upon "
"his glass perch,⟪k:12⟫looking down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫대천사는 여전히 ⟪k:12⟫오만하게 나를 "
"보았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3685A8D2_76B9_410A_92EE_946FC39B311A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35c5a6de1dd6307f82303af256e9b78f013f77b6a95bd927d5f901235ada306b
#. default-sha256: 156e1fdd33222a93dc03f5338bdcd9347d87ed7304a6d3a300a9beb60995e534
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3685A8D2_76B9_410A_92EE_946FC39B311A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His gaze almost seemed... ⟪k:1⟫judgmental."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아니면 ⟪k:1⟫이번에는 내 행실을 나무라는 걸까……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2B06C58F_460D_4798_B82E_E24EB9845EA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 879b210a9bdeee96f7260b2c74487b00a91d4aac30ee217430a8cea868e5db32
#. default-sha256: 129a0aee0e2bbec9dd8b36858c834caf98a5cd6325c762b3058692a0cb6998b3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2B06C58F_460D_4798_B82E_E24EB9845EA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I marched for the tower, unconcerned."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫내 발길은 멈추지 않고―― 탑으로 갔다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_923AF344_9FE7_4626_B420_7B87C0EBD422
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bddf9a109cb24c8cb0c58f0aaceecb00ee8fdc95792e5a801d6052693531d401
#. default-sha256: 2d8264e076ff17e2f31282d07cd0f724c18173562aa6c823a5caf24553cd87af
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_923AF344_9FE7_4626_B420_7B87C0EBD422"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For the day someone would truly set me free."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저를 진정한 의미로 풀어 줄 사람을 ⟪k:1⟫손꼽아 기다렸죠."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cca4cfe6c838822cab4c6b168c6d0ea98ebb0d89eb34d58341c51ba7ac4a96d
#. default-sha256: 26c34e5b78ad93f2cf7278e203698314f2967ac19e3f8c6a848edf431197069d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That you were led here—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that you were ⟪k:3⟫meant⟪k:4⟫ to come to this place."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신은 틀림없이 ⟪k:1⟫필연적으로 이 저택에 오신 거예요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_83BBBECD_3144_4476_8C30_E5D98FFBA6B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58b9c41eadda857c33ea5c925aeb0d89da1e5be70aa8f16a7b2e02cd02212570
#. default-sha256: d5372794417bb44b6e9d26550b14ebebfc5737b33479a821b7b16a2de1748e7d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_83BBBECD_3144_4476_8C30_E5D98FFBA6B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I know how it feels to be locked up...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to be tortured and used for others’ gain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫유폐당하고―― 핍박당하여―― 남을 위해 희생되는 등――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……저는 그런 고통을 ⟪k:3⟫잘 알아요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_073CCD59_A5F1_4026_98A1_77E035B7B0DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 013768e38f52042956fac6a90c6ecf505c05b2f39d6c4b6ad6f3bed072820cb0
#. default-sha256: f37e84c6f04b4d2e3e5c0fbdf037dcc53f7d99cdafeba3bdf4f12df97736346f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_073CCD59_A5F1_4026_98A1_77E035B7B0DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and I shall be the only one to have compassion for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저만이 당신을 자애롭게 대해 드릴게요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B32E596E_4255_43C7_A3F1_2A0BD187862D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04f198939adba2b8848136a34d7deff01676d474f20577bd4ddddd263988830a
#. default-sha256: c5e655b67bf39fb7c3f9f83ac228c9c9be526ba9411d68f66954ce223c08809f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B32E596E_4255_43C7_A3F1_2A0BD187862D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You were the only one to stay at my side..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신만이 제 곁에 있어 주셨듯이……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2FEB5F5D_D126_46AD_92AA_E236698C8F5C
