#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bb2cc9305b5977383b75e8eda521f116dcff9c7ed01bd497e7025017c9868d5
#. default-sha256: 156033a45b6c4128030b12940938814852c3229fb1ea90e4a4cf6d1712d5714e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CE2C3D9A_0F22_4351_83D0_38C93BCABC0D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And nothing else."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그게 다였다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3905A0DF_5399_40E6_89EA_481CCE30AF81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66091f2bfb32e502d34895cde6cba0f73ed44a570e91cf26af05ccf508c5472c
#. default-sha256: a2ff9d0e4a99a4b5ce0df70a7b85d4e3b15406b0bc23ae17cf53a28ebaab59fe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3905A0DF_5399_40E6_89EA_481CCE30AF81"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Thank you... ⟪k:1⟫for opening the door."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫문을 열어 주셔서…… ⟪k:1⟫고마워요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D7BF15E8_BDB8_49BE_9389_3050755E9FC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 050a8bbdd9348c11246dc07c365028ae9041a9e04b9030bd30c61bfb3040c5d6
#. default-sha256: 27d8bf21d4ed10e0ce0ef5d07dc7236d8de5dfc6af6ceba15cfe1b9404ffdd26
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D7BF15E8_BDB8_49BE_9389_3050755E9FC2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The skeleton, which had been sitting there as long as I had been at this house, had vanished "
"without a trace."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫오랫동안 있던 백골 시체가 ⟪k:1⟫홀연히 사라져 있었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C1990B51_6F38_4EE4_9AB4_3AA0E740A217
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8cee729c9324890a3475101c58555f6da433170001fc584926e363c88ec9958
#. default-sha256: 808381d993ab434281d1db5b8d9c83bb17e4fb398bb33769d8a04d90a4b36428
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C1990B51_6F38_4EE4_9AB4_3AA0E740A217"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I spun around, my gaze darting back and forth across the chamber,⟪k:1⟫but there was no one "
"there—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫주위를 살피다 ⟪k:1⟫뒤를 확인했다. ⟪k:2⟫하지만 누가 있진 않았고――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3717CEB8_6B08_4EF7_A689_0AE58EACA40A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cffcf8fd320282f1bf44cbd42c397092ceb42b93f58d0c01fc69724d44b75b19
#. default-sha256: 6d57aa0a3424e9e85327ee1530e8522292751394acd5646ce15faae05afbf12b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3717CEB8_6B08_4EF7_A689_0AE58EACA40A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You gave me the chance to have my revenge."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫저는――― 복수가 가능해졌어요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5C785F31_06F7_4173_9DE7_2858777CFD91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7873f89d600a6e723f9fba5925aeb62c25eab1ce6bb0c4f7fc8e4fddd43c410d
#. default-sha256: 18591ac13238ba7dfb68e8dd1ab8860f60b7e4ff06bec7863d7e35f168cadc7b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5C785F31_06F7_4173_9DE7_2858777CFD91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Revenge...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……복수……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_17FE593C_D11B_4B3A_9B4A_FF51BD304787
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b16f5e3bf76b128a55bf1fff8ec89c8f06e1a1beca16afb8a29e13eb391eb8c5
#. default-sha256: 59d97bd53c01ee3306672d7c963f42e6ce8ce034ac98c8f5a82083128a951d4a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17FE593C_D11B_4B3A_9B4A_FF51BD304787"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, I can make those men suffer a hell even worse than the one they put me through..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저를 나락으로 떨군 그 남자들에게……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫제가 겪은 것보다 더한 절망을……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7C059B14_A129_4954_80FC_3C436FFA9B93
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af0c7b3104cdf083e44930f2a906f5ac6e41395ebe1a0000b8ba3872d41538c2
#. default-sha256: 740fb4cd1edcd44ef25a6396aade9d6d8a6cc06ce178b1bfaf61df526ac0fb92
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7C059B14_A129_4954_80FC_3C436FFA9B93"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hah... ⟪k:1⟫haha... ⟪k:2⟫hahaha..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫훗, ⟪k:1⟫……후후…… ⟪k:2⟫후후후………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A4FDA90C_FB78_4D12_9A5B_61011E6CB9DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9ca498be14c0e8a81084a779fe85d691078f9dc630b83ba9277a5d3dca5ac79
#. default-sha256: 7bd96f6f619d59c1fd7b1f5d7142902eed5160af9071edbbfb884403d39e5591
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A4FDA90C_FB78_4D12_9A5B_61011E6CB9DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahahahahahaha..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아하하하하하하…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E057D1CB_B59B_439E_AE89_1CA6201F6CE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15d2b31b4d889debba3de0f66864604a5c006e83b2c7a5f4353785e20a8060e0
#. default-sha256: 6bb3a6758311390b9285c6d2b69ea8c26311a0bdc8df888b10144cf53e2bdafe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E057D1CB_B59B_439E_AE89_1CA6201F6CE0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, you poor dear. They locked you up here without telling you whose house it was?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그것도 모르고 ⟪k:1⟫이 저택에 갇히셨나요?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫아아…… 참 딱한 사람이군요……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D110955E_8C94_4B5F_8B3B_023D2D661687
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1882d74ab7a041b65321c016abf0435b4ab6c5737fe9b45cc1003c9c23c9948c
#. default-sha256: 52aef0d0a1ee4a87f59062a5c3dc36262a84a20a60cba477599285ad84b1028c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D110955E_8C94_4B5F_8B3B_023D2D661687"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You sad, pathetic thing...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though that’s exactly the kind of person I needed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫참으로 딱해요……, ⟪k:1⟫그래서…… 좋은 거지만요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_021FDB46_4407_4465_A38D_7CB739227033
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ed9e4adf3ed6f09b5f26e1948ad21750d8acf8ebe560b99a87e308dbdbf5922
#. default-sha256: 5d39fd343e0484bd2807f13e96a7d1a1f03e8fe675c6c42573aff0330714e56f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_021FDB46_4407_4465_A38D_7CB739227033"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’re... ⟪k:1⟫You’re not the witch, are you...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……설마…… ⟪k:1⟫진짜로…… 마녀야……?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_628FA3F9_73B9_45FC_9FBF_59CF1C8441D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b383e5dcbdaef5a726e9e5bf15aa68cc8e628103e7846a71abfd69fbb2cfd54a
#. default-sha256: ce598a79f297ce004aadafd42d957298fc44d83f0fcffb42c7f8969bfa1f2197
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_628FA3F9_73B9_45FC_9FBF_59CF1C8441D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I assumed... ⟪k:1⟫the witch was nothing but a legend. A tale..."
